do GameManager.lock_player()
do CutSceneManager.start_cutscene()
Boss: HA! HA! HA!
Boss: Now, who do we have here? Quite the small specimen.
Boss: A human exterminator, I presume? How precious.
Boss: So, you're the one who's been terrorizing my babies. Hmph. I’ll give you this, little human... you’re tougher than you look.
Boss: Unfortunately, I cannot allow you to continue. The Age of the RAT is upon us... and I will not let a single soul stand in the way of our ascension!
Boss: Oh, do try to look excited! Take it as a compliment, dear. Few are granted the honor of facing me in combat. You are about to witness perfection incarnate!
Boss: And now, dear human... prepare yourself for a SLOW... PAINFUL... DEMISE!
Boss: HA! HA! HA!
ShopMan: What in tarnation...? I've seen my fair share of mutant beasts, Rookie, but never in all my years have I seen a rat display this kind of sapience.
ShopMan: This is... troubling. Something's not right here.
ShopMan: Whatever's going on, it's bigger than a nest of oversized rodents. Something's stirring out there... something we don't yet understand.
ShopMan: Be on your guard, Rookie. This ain't gonna be a cakewalk.
do GameManager.unlock_player()
do CutSceneManager.end_cutscene()
[wait time="1.0"]
do CutSceneManager.start_boss_fight()